TI  - Retrieving a malpositioned tracheobronchial stent utilizing Amplatz gooseneck 
      snare: a case report.
PG  - 291-3
AB  - Tracheobronchial stents play a major role in the management of tracheobronchial 
      stenoses and/or bronchomalacia. A very few techniques have been described in 
      literature to remove misplaced or malpositioned tracheobronchial stents. This is 
      a case report describing a technique to retrieve a malpositioned stent utilizing 
      Amplatz gooseneck snare.
