TI  - Management of recurrent distal tracheal stenosis using an endoprosthesis: a case 
      report.
PG  - 121-5
AB  - The authors report the case of a patient with recurrent distal tracheal stenosis 
      after several tracheal resections. A T-Y tracheobronchial stent was inserted for 
      the management of distal airway obstruction. The prosthesis was adapted based on 
      the specifications obtained through a computed tomography scan of the chest with 
      three-dimensional reconstruction.
